on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <3>
  [  5] extcall 40 .............................. <random(3)>
  [  8] setlocal 0 .............................. x = random(3)
  [ 10] getlocal 0 .............................. <x>
  [ 12] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 15] eq ...................................... <x = 1>
  [ 16] jmpifz [ 35] ............................ if x = 1 then
  [ 19] pushcons 0 .............................. <"2,3,1">
  [ 21] setglobal 118 ........................... monk2 = "2,3,1"
  [ 24] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 27] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 29] extcall 2 ............................... <marker(1)>
  [ 31] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <marker(1)>
  [ 33] extcall 3 ............................... go(marker(1))
  [ 35] ret
end
